,"end":15.24},{"word":"higher—","start":15.24,"end":15.76}]},{"id":2,"speaker":"narrator","text":"I straightened myself to speak as was proper,\nbut a vision appeared that drew me so close\nI forgot my intended confession entirely.\nAs faces reflect back through polished glass\nor clear, still water—not so deep\nthat the bottom disappears—\nreturning our features so faintly\nthat a white pearl upon a forehead\ncomes no less quickly to our sight,\nso I saw many faces eager to speak.\nI made the opposite error of the man\nwho fell in love with his own reflection.\nThe moment I noticed them,\nthinking they were mirror images,\nI turned to see who stood behind me\nand saw nothing, then looked forward again\ninto the light of my sweet guide,\nwho smiled with kindling in her holy eyes.","startTime":15.76,"endTime":59.44,"words":[{"word":"I","start":15.841,"end":16.121},{"word":"straightened","start":16.121,"end":16.481},{"word":"myself","start":16.481,"end":17.041},{"word":"to","start":17.041,"end":17.161},{"word":"speak","start":17.161,"end":17.601},{"word":"as","start":17.601,"end":17.801},{"word":"was","start":17.801,"end":18.121},{"word":"proper,","start":18.121,"end":18.961},{"word":"but","start":18.961,"end":19.121},{"word":"a","start":19.121,"end":19.361},{"word":"vision","start":19.361,"end":19.761},{"word":"appeared","start":19.761,"end":20.081},{"word":"that","start":20.081,"end":20.201},{"word":"drew","start":20.201,"end":20.401},{"word":"me","start":20.401,"end":20.761},{"word":"so","start":20.761,"end":20.961},{"word":"close","start":20.961,"end":21.601},{"word":"I","start":21.601,"end":21.881},{"word":"forgot","start":21.881,"end":22.161},{"word":"my","start":22.161,"end":22.361},{"word":"intended","start":22.361,"end":22.801},{"word":"confession","start":22.801,"end":23.441},{"word":"entirely.","start":23.441,"end":24.881},{"word":"As","start":24.881,"end":25.121},{"word":"faces","start":25.121,"end":25.601},{"word":"reflect","start":25.601,"end":26.081},{"