 more or to make yourselves more beloved?\"\nFirst she smiled a little with the other shades,\nthen answered me so full of joy\nshe seemed to burn with love's first fire:","startTime":150.4,"endTime":183.6,"words":[{"word":"I","start":150.481,"end":150.761},{"word":"said","start":150.761,"end":150.921},{"word":"to","start":150.921,"end":151.041},{"word":"her:","start":151.041,"end":151.841},{"word":"\"In","start":151.841,"end":152.081},{"word":"your","start":152.081,"end":152.401},{"word":"miraculous","start":152.401,"end":153.281},{"word":"appearance","start":153.281,"end":154.081},{"word":"something","start":154.081,"end":154.481},{"word":"divine","start":154.481,"end":155.201},{"word":"shines","start":155.201,"end":155.681},{"word":"that","start":155.681,"end":155.921},{"word":"I","start":155.921,"end":156.001},{"word":"cannot","start":156.001,"end":156.401},{"word":"name,","start":156.401,"end":157.281},{"word":"transforming","start":157.281,"end":158.081},{"word":"you","start":158.081,"end":158.241},{"word":"from","start":158.241,"end":158.401},{"word":"our","start":158.401,"end":158.641},{"word":"first","start":158.641,"end":158.961},{"word":"understanding.","start":158.961,"end":160.481},{"word":"That's","start":160.481,"end":160.801},{"word":"why","start":160.801,"end":160.961},{"word":"I","start":160.961,"end":161.121},{"word":"was","start":161.121,"end":161.321},{"word":"slow","start":161.321,"end":161.481},{"word":"to","start":161.481,"end":161.601},{"word":"remember,","start":161.601,"end":162.641},{"word":"but","start":162.641,"end":162.801},{"word":"what","start":162.801,"end":162.961},{"word":"you","start":162.961,"end":163.121},{"word":"tell","start":163.121,"end":163.281},{"word":"me","start":163.281,"end":163.521},{"word":"now","start":163.521,"end":163.841},{"word":"helps","start":163.841,"end":164.241},{"word":"so","start":164.241,"end":164.481},{"word":"much","start":164.481,"end":164.801},{"word":"that","start":164.801,"end":165.041},{"word":"r