e","start":180.881,"end":181.161},{"word":"seemed","start":181.161,"end":181.481},{"word":"to","start":181.481,"end":181.801},{"word":"burn","start":181.801,"end":182.081},{"word":"with","start":182.081,"end":182.241},{"word":"love's","start":182.241,"end":182.801},{"word":"first","start":182.801,"end":183.041},{"word":"fire:","start":183.041,"end":183.6}]},{"id":9,"speaker":"piccarda","text":"Brother, the virtue of love quiets our will,\nmaking us wish only for what we have\nand thirst for nothing more.\nIf we aspired to greater heights,\nour longings would clash\nwith the will of Him who places us here—\nwhich you'll see finds no room in these circles\nif dwelling in love is necessary here,\nand if you consider well love's nature.\nIndeed, it's essential to this blessed existence\nto remain within the divine will,\nso that our very wishes become one.\nThus, as we stand station above station\nthroughout this realm, the whole realm is pleased,\nas is the King who makes His will our will.\nAnd His will is our peace—the sea\ntoward which everything moves\nthat He creates and nature makes.","startTime":183.6,"endTime":231.04,"words":[{"word":"Brother,","start":183.6,"end":184.48},{"word":"the","start":184.48,"end":184.64},{"word":"virtue","start":184.64,"end":185.12},{"word":"of","start":185.12,"end":185.28},{"word":"love","start":185.28,"end":185.92},{"word":"quiets","start":185.92,"end":186.56},{"word":"our","start":186.56,"end":186.72},{"word":"will,","start":186.72,"end":187.52},{"word":"making","start":187.52,"end":187.84},{"word":"us","start":187.84,"end":188.16},{"word":"wish","start":188.16,"end":188.52},{"word":"only","start":188.52,"end":188.8},{"word":"for","start":188.8,"end":188.96},{"word":"what","start":188.96,"end":189.12},{"word":"we","start":189.12,"end":189.36},{"word":"have","start":189.36,"end":189.92},{"word":"and","start":189.92,"end":190.16},{"word":"thirst","start":190.16,"end":190.64},{"word":"for","start":190.64,"end":190.88},{"word":"nothing