52},{"word":"to","start":253.52,"end":253.64},{"word":"the","start":253.64,"end":253.76},{"word":"end.","start":253.76,"end":254.16}]},{"id":11,"speaker":"piccarda","text":"A perfect life and high merit placed in heaven\na lady above us, by whose rule\npeople in your world dress and veil themselves\nto watch and sleep until death\nbeside that Spouse who accepts every vow\nthat love shapes to His pleasure.\nTo follow her, I fled the world as a girl\nand enclosed myself in her habit,\npledging myself to her order's path.\nThen men more accustomed to evil than good\ntore me from that sweet cloister—\nGod knows what my life became after.\nThis other splendor revealing herself\nat my right side, kindled\nwith all our sphere's illumination,\nshares what I say of myself—\nshe too was a nun, and likewise\nthe sacred veil's shadow was taken from her head.\nBut when she too was returned to the world\nagainst her will and proper custom,\nshe never removed the veil from her heart.\nThis is the radiance of great Constance,\nwho from Swabia's second wind\nbrought forth the third and final power.","startTime":254.16,"endTime":317.92,"words":[{"word":"A","start":254.16,"end":254.4},{"word":"perfect","start":254.4,"end":254.96},{"word":"life","start":254.96,"end":255.44},{"word":"and","start":255.44,"end":255.68},{"word":"high","start":255.68,"end":256},{"word":"merit","start":256,"end":256.64},{"word":"placed","start":256.64,"end":257.04},{"word":"in","start":257.04,"end":257.16},{"word":"heaven","start":257.16,"end":257.52},{"word":"a","start":257.52,"end":257.68},{"word":"lady","start":257.68,"end":258.24},{"word":"above","start":258.24,"end":258.48},{"word":"us,","start":258.48,"end":259.12},{"word":"by","start":259.12,"end":259.28},{"word":"whose","start":259.28,"end":259.6},{"word":"rule","start":259.6,"end":260.08},{"word":"people","start":260.08,"end":260.48},{"word":"in","start":260.48,"end":260.64},{"word":"your","start":260.64,"end":260.88},{"word":"world","start":260.88,